{
  "format_version": 1,
  "id": "crypt-of-the-necromancer",
  "title": { "en": "Crypt of the Necromancer", "es": "La cripta del nigromante" },
  "start": "inicio",
  "variables": [
    {
      "id": "destreza",
      "label": { "en": "Skill", "es": "Destreza" },
      "visible": true,
      "kind": { "int": { "min": 0, "max": 12, "initial": 0 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "resistencia",
      "label": { "en": "Stamina", "es": "Resistencia" },
      "visible": true,
      "kind": { "int": { "min": 0, "max": 20, "initial": 12 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "vida_esqueleto",
      "kind": { "int": { "min": 0, "max": 6, "initial": 6 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "tirada",
      "kind": { "int": { "min": 0, "max": 40, "initial": 0 } }
    },
    {
      "id": "esqueleto_vencido",
      "kind": { "bool": { "initial": false } }
    }
  ],
  "items": [
    { "id": "antorcha", "name": { "en": "Torch", "es": "Antorcha" } },
    { "id": "llave-de-hierro", "name": { "en": "Iron key", "es": "Llave de hierro" } }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "inicio",
      "text": {
        "en": "You stop at the entrance to the necromancer's crypt. Before you go down, put your skill to the test.",
        "es": "Te detienes ante la entrada de la cripta del nigromante. Antes de bajar, pon a prueba tu destreza."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "tirar-destreza",
          "label": { "en": "Roll one die and add 6 to set your skill", "es": "Tira un dado y suma 6 para fijar tu destreza" },
          "effects": [
            { "roll": { "dice": { "count": 1, "sides": 6, "modifier": 6 }, "store": "destreza" } }
          ],
          "target": "vestibulo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vestibulo",
      "text": {
        "en": "A torch burns beside a locked iron door.\nTo the north, a passage fades into the darkness.",
        "es": "Una antorcha arde junto a una puerta de hierro cerrada.\nAl norte, un pasillo se pierde en la oscuridad."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "coger-antorcha",
          "label": { "en": "Take the torch", "es": "Coger la antorcha" },
          "when": { "not": { "has_item": "antorcha" } },
          "effects": [{ "give": "antorcha" }],
          "target": "vestibulo"
        },
        {
          "id": "abrir-puerta",
          "label": { "en": "Open the iron door with the key", "es": "Abrir la puerta de hierro con la llave" },
          "when": { "has_item": "llave-de-hierro" },
          "effects": [{ "take": "llave-de-hierro" }, { "score": 100 }],
          "target": "camara-del-tesoro"
        },
        {
          "id": "ir-norte",
          "label": { "en": "Follow the passage north", "es": "Avanzar por el pasillo del norte" },
          "target": "pasillo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pasillo",
      "text": {
        "en": "The passage opens onto a chamber of bones. Beyond it, a pit cuts across the way.",
        "es": "El pasillo desemboca en una sala de huesos. Más allá, un foso corta el paso."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "luchar",
          "label": { "en": "An armed skeleton rises: fight", "es": "Un esqueleto armado se alza: luchar" },
          "when": { "not": { "flag": "esqueleto_vencido" } },
          "effects": [{ "cue": { "music": { "asset": "musica-combate" } } }],
          "target": "combate"
        },
        {
          "id": "ir-al-foso",
          "label": { "en": "Approach the pit", "es": "Acercarte al foso" },
          "when": { "flag": "esqueleto_vencido" },
          "target": "foso"
        },
        {
          "id": "volver",
          "label": { "en": "Go back to the entrance hall", "es": "Volver al vestíbulo" },
          "target": "vestibulo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "combate",
      "text": {
        "en": "The skeleton attacks. Roll two dice and add your skill: on 14 or more you wound it; otherwise you lose 2 stamina.",
        "es": "El esqueleto te ataca. Tira dos dados y suma tu destreza: con 14 o más lo hieres; si no, pierdes 2 de resistencia."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "atacar",
          "label": { "en": "Attack", "es": "Atacar" },
          "effects": [
            { "roll": { "dice": { "count": 2, "sides": 6 }, "modifier_var": "destreza", "store": "tirada" } },
            {
              "if": {
                "when": { "var_cmp": { "var": "tirada", "op": "ge", "value": 14 } },
                "then": [
                  { "add": { "var": "vida_esqueleto", "delta": -2 } },
                  { "cue": { "sfx": { "asset": "sfx-golpe" } } }
                ],
                "otherwise": [{ "add": { "var": "resistencia", "delta": -2 } }]
              }
            },
            {
              "if": {
                "when": { "var_cmp": { "var": "vida_esqueleto", "op": "le", "value": 0 } },
                "then": [
                  { "set": { "var": "esqueleto_vencido", "value": true } },
                  { "score": 50 },
                  { "cue": "stop_music" },
                  { "goto": "victoria-esqueleto" }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "if": {
                "when": { "var_cmp": { "var": "resistencia", "op": "le", "value": 0 } },
                "then": [{ "cue": "stop_music" }, { "goto": "muerte" }]
              }
            }
          ],
          "target": "combate"
        },
        {
          "id": "huir",
          "label": { "en": "Flee to the entrance hall (lose 2 stamina)", "es": "Huir hacia el vestíbulo (pierdes 2 de resistencia)" },
          "effects": [
            { "add": { "var": "resistencia", "delta": -2 } },
            { "cue": "stop_music" },
            {
              "if": {
                "when": { "var_cmp": { "var": "resistencia", "op": "le", "value": 0 } },
                "then": [{ "goto": "muerte" }]
              }
            }
          ],
          "target": "vestibulo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "victoria-esqueleto",
      "text": {
        "en": "The skeleton crumbles. Among its bones, an iron key glints.",
        "es": "El esqueleto se desmorona. Entre sus huesos brilla una llave de hierro."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "coger-llave",
          "label": { "en": "Take the key and return to the passage", "es": "Coger la llave y volver al pasillo" },
          "effects": [{ "give": "llave-de-hierro" }],
          "target": "pasillo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "foso",
      "text": {
        "en": "The pit is wide and its floor bristles with stakes. You need 12 or more (one die plus your skill) to jump it.",
        "es": "El foso es ancho y su fondo está erizado de estacas. Necesitas 12 o más (un dado más tu destreza) para saltarlo."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "saltar",
          "label": { "en": "Jump the pit", "es": "Saltar el foso" },
          "effects": [
            {
              "roll": {
                "dice": { "count": 1, "sides": 6 },
                "modifier_var": "destreza",
                "test": { "at_least": 12, "success": "otra-orilla", "failure": "caida" }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "retroceder",
          "label": { "en": "Back away to the passage", "es": "Retroceder al pasillo" },
          "target": "pasillo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "caida",
      "text": {
        "en": "You slip and fall to the bottom of the pit. The stakes cut into you.",
        "es": "Resbalas y caes al fondo del foso. Las estacas te hieren."
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "trepar",
          "label": { "en": "Climb back up to the passage (lose 3 stamina)", "es": "Trepar de vuelta al pasillo (pierdes 3 de resistencia)" },
          "effects": [
            { "add": { "var": "resistencia", "delta": -3 } },
            {
              "if": {
                "when": { "var_cmp": { "var": "resistencia", "op": "le", "value": 0 } },
                "then": [{ "goto": "muerte" }]
              }
            }
          ],
          "target": "pasillo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "otra-orilla",
      "text": {
        "en": "You land on the far side and find a secret way up to the surface. You escape, though without the treasure.",
        "es": "Aterrizas al otro lado y descubres una salida secreta hacia la superficie. Escapas, aunque sin el tesoro."
      },
      "ending": { "id": "huida", "kind": "neutral" }
    },
    {
      "id": "camara-del-tesoro",
      "text": {
        "en": "The door gives way. The necromancer's treasure is yours.",
        "es": "La puerta cede. El tesoro del nigromante es tuyo."
      },
      "ending": { "id": "tesoro", "kind": "victory" }
    },
    {
      "id": "muerte",
      "text": {
        "en": "Your strength fails you. Your adventure ends in the crypt.",
        "es": "Tus fuerzas se agotan. Tu aventura termina en la cripta."
      },
      "ending": { "id": "muerte", "kind": "defeat" }
    }
  ]
}
